&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;High motivation and interest for designing, programming, and solving problems and improving business processes and company performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
