&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are the strategic mastermind behind the digital connectivity of our enterprise clients. As a Senior Integration Consultant, you don&#39;t just build interfaces; you define the integration architecture for massive automotive and financial ecosystems. You operate at the highest level of technical complexity, ensuring that &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; serves as the beating heart of a connected landscape. In this high-impact role at a hidden champion of mobility tech, you act as a technical authority, a trusted advisor to client CIOs, and a mentor who elevates the entire integration practice within Sofico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You take full architectural ownership of large-scale integration projects, designing resilient, high-volume data exchange ecosystems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You act as a strategic advisor to our clients&#39; IT leadership, guiding them through complex decisions regarding API strategies and system decoupling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You define and enforce integration best practices and standards, ensuring consistency and quality across multiple projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You serve as the ultimate escalation point for the most critical and complex technical challenges, solving problems others cannot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You lead and mentor a team of integration consultants, fostering a culture of technical excellence and continuous innovation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You collaborate directly with our R&amp;amp;D department to shape the future of our core integration framework based on real-world enterprise needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have an extensive track record in software architecture and system integration, ideally within the financial or automotive sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You possess mastery of integration patterns (e.g., SOA, Microservices, Event-Driven Architecture) and technologies (Java, REST, SOAP, Kafka, Camel)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are driven by the challenge of orchestrating complex IT landscapes and have a vision for how modern systems should communicate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have proven experience in technical leadership, enjoying the role of a mentor and knowledge multiplier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You communicate with authority and clarity, capable of convincing C-level stakeholders of your technical vision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are fluent in German and English and thrive in a role where you can set the direction rather than just following the path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, you’ll join an international, multicultural company with over 30 years of success. We double in size every five years, staying true to our open and collaborative culture even as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe you should be in control of your own career. That’s why we put your personal development first. With an extensive onboarding program, you’ll spend six months learning our products and getting to know the organization with the support of a dedicated job coach. Your learning doesn’t stop there; we’ll continue to offer opportunities for growth and development throughout your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in a modern, accessible office with flexible and hybrid work options that allow you to balance work and life. In addition, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and the option to work from home. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Employee discounts, eGym Wellpass, Bike Leasing and a subsidized Jobticket for public transportation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Company pension scheme with optional additional occupational disability insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Growth potential through personalized learning and development plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A vibrant team culture with regular team events and a company weekend. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

