&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are the expert navigator for our most complex client projects. As a Senior Implementation Consultant, you leverage your deep industry knowledge and technical expertise to steer global automotive and leasing giants through critical software implementations. You don&#39;t just configure a system; you design the future operational landscape of our clients. In this pivotal role within a hidden champion of mobility tech, you act as a mentor to your team and a strategic partner to our customers, ensuring that our software &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; delivers maximum impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
